<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="h">Hebriuthek</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEBRIUTHEK shii Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebriuthek</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBRIUTHEK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hebriuthek ro jigi</char> ne ibrog Masipho shii zey, hanyie è zey ramuii pha gidieg chiang shii diig si srane Masi pha migi shii ne thoh bsa hà rey dun. Zeypho è doh yi ne Isu Masi ne zai nane iidohè shii dong pha Hamangkhung-aphuii rone ithek migi shii lububo rek phi. Hì rek pha ai ne zai uom shii dong phi: (1) Hanyie ai è diigchiao shii zud pha ji è Aphuii shii zai nuii pha ji shii dab pha ji è Isu ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro idang pha Dufuii rey ro. Hamangkhung-aphuii dufuii rey pha ji è, Isu ne Surua ihèg pha chaigthek è chiih-è hamangkhliiethek chiih-è Moses awai è de boh ba ro. (2) Isu ne idang pha phabi nane Surua Ihèg pha phabithek è de boh ba rone Hamangkhung-aphuii è yaojong ro. (3) Isu pha chiang è migipho layog chiih-è rum chiih-è iy pha ji è; ragia rey ge ro. Chiih-è Isu ne phabi dumuii duiine, zai giawo shii phi ro, nyie hìne Hebriu pha giang pha muhui shii khlem pha ibeymuthung ji è midong doh noh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israelthek pha phaluii shii ìdlie pha branthek ro migi ro ò ji duiine yie srane (ithoh 11), zeypho è thamphothek shii migi shii rai bone yao, chiih-è ithoh 12 shii ai è airo jigi hì thamphothek shii athodang pha iidohè thog pha migi shii chiih-è mieg yi Isu shii riig ne rai bone yao, chiih-è nyie diig chiih-è diigkhui ne ithek shii thog magunde zud bone khung ro. Jigi hìne yua pha nane phriie pha miyaogamthek rog shii kheb dun ro.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi: Masi ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro zab dong pha ji ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi ne hamangkhliiethek è de huak ne boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi ne Moses nane Joshua è de huak ne boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi ro phabi ne zab è de huak ne boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi ro shiinyie ne zab è boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1—9:22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi ro zid ne zab è boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Migi ne bajo boh ro <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang yi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jong Sha pha misia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idohhè pha miyaogamthek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii miyaogam ro Dufuii re-è</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Buyo Hamangkhung-aphuii è bajo ishak chiih-è chaigthek pha ji è bajo lumuii è gethek blangthek yao ro, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>jishii thuh pha iidohè pha inai shii ne awai dufuii ji è gethek shii yao ro. Ai jia chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii è hamangnyiak shii rab ro, chiih-è iidohè shii zab pha manathek shii muspho rey pha Hamangkhung-aphuii è gua ro. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie pha chuang pha ji shii mia ro chiih-è jine Hamangkhung-aphuii awai chai duiine rey yi, airo bohbluthek miyaogamthek è hamangnyiak hà rai yie ro. Zab bran ro layog shii khung phi pha ji rey ched pha iidoh è, ai ne hamangkhung hà Hamangkhung-aphuii ro giu blu um pha phazoi hà dug dun ro.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro zabèboh dufuii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii ithek è de bajo boh ibeng phi pha duiine, Dufuii ne hamangkhliiethek è de bajo boh rab phi ro. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Chng 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Phal 17:13</ref> </char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii ne khuchung de hanyie hamangkhliiethek shii ayao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nathek gu dufuii ro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Sudoh gu ne nathek Aphuii rey ruii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Hamangkhung-aphuii è hanyie hamangkhliiethek chiang shii ayao ro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Gune ai Aphuii rey ruii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">chiih-è ai ne gu Dufuii rey ruii phro.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Iphy 32:43</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note> Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai ro igobigiak pha Dufuii shii sohjambling hà thoh shii, ai è yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Zab Hamangkhung-aphuii ro hamangkhliiethek aishii misiasia chid phro.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Chng 104:4</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note> Jishii hamangkhliiethek chiang shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Hamangkhung-aphuii è airo hamangkhliiethek ne hasamthek rab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">chiih-è airo khiaothek shii ne bai hang pha rab phro.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Chng 45:6-7</ref> </char>
    </note> Jishii Dufuii chiang shii, Hamangkhung-aphuii è yao:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Hamangkhung-aphuii wo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Naro Sajathua, Hamangkhung-aphuii wo, ne idang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hamangkhung-aphuii ne naro sajathua.</char></note> naro Sajathua, ne, idang nane idang rey bo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Na ne nawai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nathek ro; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey ne um phane</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Airo.</char></note> branthek rog shii isiie è kho ro.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Na ne nyie shii rangsua ji shii miie chiih-è nyie yi asi jishii khiijai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Ji pha chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii, na ro Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii gua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">chiih-è ilab pha lubo ne ai è na iijiiakthek shii phi pha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ji è de bajo boh na shii phi ro.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Chng 102:25-27</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note> Ai ne hì de yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Ithong, na ne, igobi sohnyiak shii rab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">chiih-è nawai ro wad sbang è hamangkhung shii rab.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Ithek ne sand ruii phro, jishii na ne asand ruii phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">ithek ne zab yungthek duiine ihèg rey dun.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Na ne ithek shii phadiig duiine jiangmuii phro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">chiih-è ithek ne yungthek duiine laidun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Jishii na ne idang pha duiine ò ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">chiih-è naro chai ne khuchungde ajong.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Chng 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Naro makpho shii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Naro lai iliing hà aruii sapho shii ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Guro phazoi hà dug bone:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Hamangkhung-aphuii ne awai ro hamangkhliiethek hanyie shii magunde khuchungde ayao ro.”<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Ji-anine, hamangkhliiethek ne nyie ga? Ithek ne ragungthek hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blia rek chiih-è hanyie è giawo shii choi pho shii nong yi pha aishii thoh ge.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bajobo giawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ji-è gethek shii ne ruang afen yi pha ji pha chiang shii gethek è yoijong pha izai shii chuh è khoh chid. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Gethek blangthek shii hamangkhliiethek è miyaogam phi pha jine zai shii doh yi, chiih-è hanyie è arekgieng, anuii pho ithek shii ne lago mua ro. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Gethek è Bajobo giawo shii isiie arek arone khi-è-rek ne, yoh ne khia magey phlei? Ithong awai igobi giawo hì yao bi, chiih-è hanyie è aishii hì yoi gathek ne izai rone khagi rek phi. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Ji pha ishak shii buangthek nane wiengthek pha zab ichuathek rek pha ji è chiih-è awai è yang pha Ragung So pha lasen ji thang pha ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii awai ro khagi shii de lao phi.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanyie jia è gathek shii giawo hà noh phi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è hamangkhliiethek shii gethek è nyie yao ramuii pha sohjambling ji shii iwo sohjambling thog ramuii pha ji shii kho pha aphi ro. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Chng 8:4-6</ref> </char></note>Ji pha chiang shii, jigi shii yao pha duiine:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Hamangkhung-aphuii wo, bran ne nyie ga, na ne ithek shii now bo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Ai ne bran bie ro, na ne ithek shii gayiig chid habey?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Na è aishii ne ìujia ishak pha hamangkhliiethek è ìu rab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">na ne aishii ilab nane biisiie rog shii rago khak phi;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bajo jigizey ne dog: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Na è ithek shii ne khophothek rab zab na è rab pha ji </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig Chng 8:6).</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>chiih-è aishii ne zab manathek shii bohkhophothek rab phi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Hì è yao jine Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii “Zab manathek shii bohkhophothek rab phi” Ji pha miyao è ne zab ne sang è lua ro, jimagunde Gethek ne thuh de bran ne zab manathek shii bohkhopho pha adoh ba ro. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Jishii Isu shii doh. Hanyie shii ai de ìujia ishak hamangkhliiethek è ìu rab ro, ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun è ai ne zab chiang iy dun. Airo iy pha diig chiang ji è ai ne thuh rago rog pha biisiie nane ilab mua pha aishii doh muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Bajo aniphiing shii noh srane airo biisiie ji thang pha diig ji è Isu ne isiie rab chid. Hì pha blia rek pha ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii rangsua um bie ro, nyieliieshii ai ne rab pha nane zab shii ruii ro. Ithek shii giawo hà noh pha ne Isu jia bie ro.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Ai ne branthek shii awaithek layogthek è sud phi, chiih-è nyimanyi ai nane hanyie shii igang rabjong pho ne ò Aphuii ro. Ji è Isu ne ithek shii awai ro haliingpho rone ho pha ji shii ne awo ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Chng 22:22</ref> </char></note> Ai è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Gune gui khuiinothek shii na è nyie rekjong phi pha ji yao phi pha ro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Gu ne na shii ithek ro male shii chiong phi pha ro.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:17">Aij 8:17</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Aij 8:18</ref></char>
    </note> Ai è de yao, “Gune guiro migi Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ruii pha ro.” Chiih-è ai è de yao, “Ichiih shii gu ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è phi pha aniphiing rog shii ro.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Ai è ithek shii aniphiing rone ho phane, ibey nane ifai bran ro, Isu awai de ithek duiine rey dun ne ithek tharohthamang ziig ji shii thang. Ai è ji rek pha jine nyieliieshii airo iy pha ji è hanyie shii iy pha blu um pha ibuii shii ai ne srobro rek mua pha ji rek, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>nyieliieshii iy pha ji è rum ne hanyie yi awaithek ro chai khiaothek rek pha ji è ichad phi. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Aij 41:8-9</ref></char></note> Hì ne sang ai è nong phi pha jine hamangkhliiethek asi ro. Ji phachiang ai è, Abraham riingthek shii ne nong phi. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Hì pha miyaosiu è airo Hamangkhung-aphuii blia shii branthek ro layogthek ne khung mua phi pha ithek ro migithek nane bushunthek pha kho Phabi rey pha zab pha lumuii shii airo khuiinothek duiine rey dun. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Chiih-è thuh ai ne hanyie chuajan ithek shii nong mua phi, nyieliieshii ai awai de chuajan nane diig rekjong.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Isu ne Moses è de bajo boh ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Hanyie shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ho pha ji ro! Guro Masipho khuiinothek, hanyie shii gathek è yao pha migi pha kho phabi shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è thoh ge pha Isu shii now bo. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Ssb 12:7</ref></char></note> Moses è Hamangkhung-aphuii hò shii awai blia shii migi rek pha duiine, Isu de Hamangkhung-aphuii è hìpha blia rek pha gua Hamangkhung-aphuii shii isiie rek. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Branthek hanyie è hò rung pha ji ai ne hò è de muna bajo boh ilab mua ro. Ji duiine Isu ne Moses è de muna ilab mua sapho ro. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Zai, zab pha hò ne hanyie jia è ne rab ro—Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii jia bie ro hanyie è zab pha manathek shii rab. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Moses ne Hamangkhung-aphuii hò shii khiao duiine isiie rek, chiih-è ai è yao pha mana jithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ne phariang shii yao pha rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Jishii Masi ne Hamangkhung-aphuii hò pha ilkhi rek shii Dufuii duiine isiie rek. Gethek è nyie shii luthong pha ji shii lububo rek ne migi rek arone gethek ne ai Hamangkhung-aphuii ro hò ro.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro branthek thung pha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Chng 95:7-11</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Ji-è chiihphado, Ragung So è yao pha duiine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">Sudoh na è Hamangkhung-aphuii goh yoi arone,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>ithek è aishii balimuang hà chai pha ruii pha ishak shii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">naro blangthek duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii shii suang rek pha duiine, nathek de lawasdai arek rabo.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è yao, ithek ne idam shawi shii gu è nyie rek pha ji riig magunde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ithek è gu shii thiisa hà chuajan.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Chiih-è gu ne jithek pha bran shii lijieg ne yao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">“Ithek ne idang gu shii ilab arek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">chiih-è gu muyung shii anuii pha rek.”<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Gu ne lijieg dun chiih-è surua sbang rab:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">“Khi hà gu è ithek shii thung pha soh phi pha ji shii ne ithek ne khuchung de akhud mua ruii phro!”<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Gu iijiiakthek, nathek è hanyie de awie pha rey chiih-è migi arek pha isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii è khid pha ji è de lubu gayiig bo. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Ji phachiang shii nathek hanyie de layog è khinrin ne lawasdai arey yi rabo, “sudoh” Jigigam ji è gethek shii nyayao bamuii pha duiine nathek ne nawaithek chung idang nong rai chid. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Gethek ro migi ibi shii um pha ji yi iidohè thogdang pha chuh è khoh arone gethek ne zab Masi rog shii iijiiakthek ro.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Chng 95:7-8</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note> Hì ne jigi è nyie yao:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nathek ne sdoh Hamangkhung-aphuii goh yoi arone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nathek ro blangthek è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii suang rek pha ishak shii rek pha duiine nathek ne lawasdai arek rabo.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Ssb 14:1-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Branthek hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro goh yoi ne chiih-è aishii ne suang rek pha ne hanyie lei? Moses è Egyph hà noh pho thek ro. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Idam shawi shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è hanyie shii lijieg? Balimuang hà iy pha layogthek shii lijieg phro. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è surua sbang rek shii, ithek ne gu è thung pha phi pha soh shii akhud mua phro—Hanyie shii yao pha jine hanyie è suang rek pha ji shii yao ro. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Chiihphado, gethek doh ro, ithek ji pha soh shii akhud mua, nyieliieshii ithek ne migi arek.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Thuh, ai è yao pha thung chiang shii Hamangkhung-aphuii gethek shii sbang mizid rek pha jine thuh de um, chiihphado, gethek shii mua yi pha gethek gayiig rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Ithek è yoi pha duiine gethek de Mua Wie yoijong. Ithek ne mua ne yoi, jishii ithek shii ne wie arey ro, nyieliieshii ithek ne yoi shii ithek ne migi rog shii achoi ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Chng 95:11</ref> </char></note> Chiihphado, gethek hanyie è migi rekpho ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è sbang rek pha thung shii choi ro. Hì ne ai miyao duiine ro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Gu ne lijieg dun chiih-è surua sbang rab:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Khi hà gu è ithek shii thung pha sohjambling phi pha ji shii ne ithek ne khuchung de akhud mua ro!’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:3">Ai è hì yao magunde airo blia ne sohjambling rab pha ishak shii jong ge. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Igo 2:2</ref> </char></note> Chiih-è damiley pha inai chiang shii ne gai pha jigigamthek shii yao ro: “Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai ro blia è damiley inai shii thung.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Chng 95:11</ref> </char></note> Ji pha miyao shii din è yao: “Khi hà gu è ithek shii thung pha soh phi pha ji shii ne ithek ne khuchung de akhud mua.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Hanyie è Mua wie shii igobi yoi pho ne thung pha ji shii achoi ro, nyieliieshii ithek ne migi arek. Chiihphado, thiisa hà, giak hanyie shii ne choi pha phi ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Chng 95:7-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Nyie yi “sudoh” rone ho pha ji shii Hamangkhung-aphuii gai inai shii rab srane ji pha izai shii riig yi. Bajo idam pha iidoh jigigam shii zeyjong pha jine ai è Dawid re-è yao:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Na è sdoh Hamangkhung-aphuii ro goh yoi arone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">Lawasdai arek rabo.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:7">Iphy 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos 22:4</ref></char>
    </note>Joshua è branthek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro thung pha sbang ji phi arone, Hamangkhung-aphuii gai inai pha chiang shii ayao chid ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Hì duiine, thiisa hàne thuh de Hamangkhung-aphuii ro damiley inai shii thung pha duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii ro branthek ne nyathung ba muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Igo 2:2</ref> </char></note> Hanyie magunde Hamangkhung-aphuii ro thung pha sbang shii choi pho ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è awairo blia è thung pha duiine ithek de awaithek ro blia è de thung muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Ji-anine, cho gethek ne, ji pha thung shii choi pha gethek khama rek mua pha ji rek haro, ji è nyieliieshii ithek è migi arek pha ji è ithek shii amua pha rek pha ji duiine gethek de jia de buyud arey yi haro. <verse eid="HEB 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro miyaogam ne isieng nane, blia rek ne, irey nyi um pha khamriie è de huak ne irey um ro, khihà luruak nane ragung si, chiih-è rungpha nane ihieng ne ò um pha jihà thog pha nyachey mua. Jine lubu pha munowthek nane chid pha ji shii chua ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Jine Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyie de a-ug mua; sohjambling shii ai è nyie rab pha jine dong khlei ro. Chiih-è gethek ro sasab ne zab aishii phi chid.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ne bajo bohkho phabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Ji-è gethek de gethek è yao pha migi shii wie è khoh ne ruii rai haro. Isu, ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Dufuii ro—Gethek shii ne Bajobo kho phabi um ro, hanyie yi Kho phabi Hamangkhung aphuii moe hà wuiijong ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Gethek ro Kho phabi jine luang jia de gethek ro zia pha rog shii bushun arey mua sapho asi ro. Ji phachiang shii, gethek shii kho phabi um hanyie shii ne gethek chiang zab pha lumuii shii chuajan jong ro, jimagunde layog arek ro. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Chiihphado cho gethek ne migi rek rai chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii biang khi hà bushun um bsa hà wuii rai haro. Thiisa hà gethek ne bushun mua srane khuchung gethek chid shii gethek shii nong mua phi pha bushun doh ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Zabèbo pha kho phabi shii ne awaithek duchoi è gua ne mizidthek zid phi chiih-è layogthek pha chiang shii mizidthek phi pha awaithek duchoi shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blia rek yi pha gua ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Ai awai ro bajo ichuathek shii zia ro, ai ne nyie de athieg pha branthek chiih-è asi pha rek pha bran ibi shii jum rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lew 9:7</ref> </char></note> Chiih-è nyieliieshii awai ne zia ro, ai ne bran layog shii mizid zid bie pha asi, jishii awai layogthek shii de zid chid phro. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Mul 28:1</ref> </char></note> Hanyie de awai shii kho phabi ilab rone agua mua phro. Jine Hamangkhung-aphuii è Aron duiine bran shii kho phabi rab pha ho pha bie ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Chng 2:7</ref></char></note> Ji duiine Masi de awai è awai shii kho phabi ilab ne ayie ro. Ji phachiang shii, Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Na ne gu dufuii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">sdoh gu ne na Aphuii rey ro.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Chng 2:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Ai ne gai ithua hà de yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Na ne Melkhizedek lumuii shii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">idang phabi rey ruii phro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek lumuii shii idang phabi rey ruii phro; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek duiine; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek lumuii shii rey.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mth 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrg 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lug 22:39-46</ref></char>
    </note> Isu ro chai sohnyiak shii ai ne misiathek nane khungthek è cho ne hanyie è aishii iy pha ji è ragia rek mua pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii miegkhothek chiih. Nyieliieshii ai ne jum nane isiie rek, ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yoi. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii Dufuii magunde airo diig ji è nuii pha ji shii dab. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Ai ne khriig rab magey shii ai ne hanyie è aishii nuiipho ro idang pha giawo pha ithua rey, <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è Melkhizedek lumuii shii aishii ne kho phabi rone yaothiek ro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kho phabi lumuii shii ne Melkhizedek; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek duiine; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek lumuii shii aishii ne Kho phabi rone yaothiek ro.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Migi thoh pho shii gidieg phriie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Ichiih shii ne gethek hìpha chiang shii yao pha miyao ne bajo um ro, jishii hìne nathek shii yua pha diig ro, nyieliieshii nathek ne gao pha ne bajo rasey ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1Khor 3:2</ref></char></note> Nathek shii ne masdo rey pha ishak ne cho ishak um—Thuh de nathek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha igobi pha mua chiang shii yua pha gai chid ba ro. Gang michie chie pha khalo shii nathek ne thuh de niu niing ba muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Hanyie magunde thuh de niu niing ba arone ai ne ani ba ro, chiih-è zai nane biidiie shii rek rone a-ìd ro. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Ji phachiang shii, gang michie ne, hanyie noi ne wie nane awie pha jishii ìdjong pha, chai thek ro.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Cho gethek de iweg muyua pha jihà wuii ne, igobi pha Masipho mua ji shii gethek ne iidoh ruiimuii haro. Gethek ne awie pha blia è khid ne chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro migi rek jong; <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>khowothek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khowothek; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Muhuithek shii.</char></note> nane wad ruii ne sia pha mua chiih-è iy ne hòi din chiih-è idang pha chuathek, hì thek shii din ne gai sarong arab haro; <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è chid arone cho gethek de ibi wuii! Chiih-è gethek ne hì rek haro.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Hanyie è awaithek migi shii thoh pho shii khi-è rek ne lubukhid din muii phlei? Ithek luang jia Hamangkhung-aphuii muchuang shii um; ithek ne hamangkhung pha lasen shii chai chiih-è Ragung So pha mathang shii choi; <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro miyaogam jine wie rone ley pha ji è ìdjong, chiih-è ithek ne thog ramuii pha Ishak pha bluthek shii than. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Chiih-è chiihphado ithek ne migi shii thoh muii! Ji-è ithek shii ne lubukhid din yi pha ne lumuii oi ro, nyieliieshii ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Dufuii shii din è bai shii zun din yi chiih-è limiang moi shii wo pha khia din yie. <verse eid="HEB 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyiak shii khirzey phi nyie shii blebbleb chiih pha haphie ji è niing chiih-è hanyie shii haipha ai blia rey muii sapho pha misiengthek shii sieng yie. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Igo 3:17-18</ref> </char></note> Jishii migemthek nane saingthek ji sieng arone jine nyie blia oi; hìne Hamangkhung-aphuii è thamai pha buii ro chiih-è jine bai è hùb ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Jishii iijiiakthek wo, gathek ne hì duiine yao magunde, nathek chiang shii gethek ne migi rek. Nathek ro giawo pha wie khirzeythek um rone gathek ne thieg. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ne haro ahan ro. Nathek è aishii miie pha doh yi chiih-è thuh de nathek è gai shii nong ramuii pha blia jine ai khuchung de abia phro. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Gathek ro Bajobo yang pha jine nathek zab jia è chid pha jine iidohè thog pha rek ne rai bo, ji è nathek è luthong pha manathek ne zai thog ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Gathek ne nathek shii skhad-ajo pha rey yi pha ayang ro, jishii hanyiethek è migi rek chiih-è lubu phiang rek pha duiine rek ne chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyie sbang rek pha ji mua boh.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro izai sbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è airo sbang Abraham shii rab shii, ai è nyie sbang rek pha ji shii rek pha rone surua thak. Ji shii ne hanyie jia de awaithek è bajo boh oi ro, awai ro surua rab pha ishak shii ai è awai ro ibeng kho ne rab. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Igo 22:16-17</ref></char></note> Ai è yao, “Gu na shii khirzey phi ruii chiih-è na shii bajo riingthek phi ruii phro ne, gu na shii sbang rek.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abraham ne lubuphiang, ji è ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyie sbangthek rek pha ji shii choi jong. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Gathek è surua thak shii, gethek è de bajo boh jia ro ibeng khoh ne thak, chiih-è surua è ne zab khnaingthek shii khriig rek phi. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Hanyie yi airo sbang shii choi pha rekpho ne ithek shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ne airo blia ji khuchung de alai phro ne gang è ìd yie pha yang ro; ji è awai ro surua ne sbang shii chohdo. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Chiihphado, hì shii ne nyi miyaothek ro, jine khuchung de alai muii chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ne ji pha chiang è biidiie arey phro. Ji-è gethek ne ai rog shii ragia doh ne gethek ibi shii ruii phi pha luthong ji shii chuh khoh bone boh lububo rek phi ro. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lew 16:2</ref> </char></note> Gethek ro chai pha jarog duiine gethek ne hìpha luthong um ro. Hì ne ragia nane izai ro, chiih-è hamangkhung pha misiahò pha yungshaig ji è dong ne zab so ithua hà khud dun. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Chng 110:4</ref></char></note> Gethek chiang shii Isu ne gethek ibi hà wuii ne chiih-è phabi Melkhizedek lumuii shii, idang pha kho phabi rey dun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">phabi Melkhizedek lumuii shii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig 5:6). </char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Phabi Melkhizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Igo 14:17-20</ref> </char>
    </note> Melkhizedek ne Salem pha saja chiih-è Zab è bajo boh Hamangkhung-aphuii phabi ro. Abraham è sajathek wi shii ai è yang ne mak è iidoh dun din shii, Melkhizedek è aishii si srane aishii khirzey phi, <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>chiih-è Abraham awai nyie yi pha ji è aishii sua jia phi. (Melkhizedek ro ibeng igobi pha miyaosiu ne “Rangsuathek pha Saja ro” Chiih-è nyieliieshii ai ne Salem pha saja habuii ne, airo ibeng pha miyaosiuthek ne “Liijiing pha Saja.”) <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melkhizedek ro aphuii nane amuii din ne airo blangthek pha hanyie ro de sasab oi ro; ai giak pha nane airo iy pha ji de nyie sasab oi ro. Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro dufuii duiine ro; ai ne idang phabi rey ne rai dun ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Chiihphado, na ne riig, ai ne khama bajo boh ro. Abraham ne, gethek ro ìd pha blang, ai è mak shii zab mua pha jine aishii sua jia shii phi. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Ssb 18:21</ref> </char></note> Chiih-è Lewi pha riingthek hanyie ne phabithek shii ne Iphey ji è yung ne Israel pha branthek è sua jia khrab yie, ithek ne Abraham ro riingthek magunde jine awaithek ro bran ji è ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melkhizedek ne Lewi riing re-è asi, jishii ai ne Abraham è sua jia khrab chiih-è aishii khirzey phi, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro sbangthek shii choi pha Abraham ji ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Hanyie jia shii khirzeythek mua pha ji shii ne hanyie jia è khirzey phi pha jine bajo boh ba rone ji shii ne nyie asi pha than pha oi sha ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Jigi shii yao pha duiine, nyayao chak arone phabithek ro sua ne bran è khrab ji pha phabithek ne iy ruii phro; jishii Melkhizedek sua jia khrab pha ne idang isieng ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Chiih-è, ji yao arone, Abraham è sua jia phi shii, Lewi è de phijong. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Ji pha ishak Lewi ne agiak ba ro, nyayao chak arone Melkhizedek è aishii si pha ishak shii Lewi ne airo blang Abraham ro siu shii ba ro.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Lewi phabithek è Israel pha bran shii Iphey phi. Thuh, Lewi pha phabi ne blia shii khriig rey arone, Aron è asi pha, hanyie jia Melkhizedek phabi lumuii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek phabi lumuii shii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig 5:6). </char></note> shii gai ichua pha phabi khia phane achid ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Phabithek laidun shii, iphey de lai dun pha rey ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Chiih-è gethek Ithong, hanyie shii hìpha manathek yao pha yoh jad è rey pha, chiih-è airo jad pha bran ne thuh thog pha phabi blia arek ba ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Hì ne wie thieg ai ne Judah jad pha bran rey ne giak ro; chiih-è Moses è phabithek pha yao magey shii ne hìpha jad shii ne ayao ro.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melkhizedek duiine gai phabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Hanyie ne Melkhizedek duiine gai phabi ne khia din ro; hìpha miyao ne din ne de miang è yao. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Aishii ne phabi rabjong ro, bran ro khohthek nane iphey re-è arab ro, jishii nyie yijong pha oi pha chai pha blu è rab ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Chng 110:4</ref></char></note> Jigi shii yao pha duiine, “Na ne idang pha phabi rey ruii Melkhizedek phabi lumuii duiine.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Melkhizedek phabi lumuii shii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(riig 5:6).</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Chiihphado, Ihèg bohkho, ji shii ne yoh ruii muii, nyieliieshii jine zia nane blia adunmey ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Moses ro Iphey shii ne nyie de khriig arab ro. Chiih-è thuh pha wie luthong phijong pha chiang ji è gethek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii wuii ro.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Chodo hà, de Hamangkhung-aphuii ro surua um ro. Jihà ne gai phabi rab pha ishak shii ji è rek pha surua oi ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Chng 110:4</ref> </char></note> Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yao shii ji pha surua ji è Isu ne phabi rey ro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Ithong ne surua sbang rab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">chiih-è iidoh ayie phro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Na ne idang pha phabi rey ruii phro.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Chiihphado, hìpha yo, è de Isu ne wie shiinyie rey phro ne sbang rab ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Yo gai de um ro: Gai phabithek bame um, nyieliieshii ithek iy dun chiih-è ithek ro blia ne athoh pha arek mua ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Jishii Isu ne idang sieng rai, chiih-è airo phabi duiine pha blia ne gai shii amua phro. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Chiih-è ji è, ai re-è hanyie Hamangkhung-aphuii shii wuii pha ji shii ragia rek phi pha, thuh nane idang rek mua ro, nyieliieshii ai ne idang isieng chiih-è ithek chiang ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii rog shii khung phi ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Chiihphado, Isu, gethek chid pha mua pha Kho Phabi ro. Ai ne so; aishii ne ichiig oi ro chiih-è aishii ne layog oi ro; aishii ne layog branthek è yoh rek srane hamangkhung lakhung è chiing phi. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lew 9:7</ref> </char></note> Ai ne gai Kho Phabithek duiine asi ro; awairo igobi pha layogthek pha chiang inaitham ne mizid zid pha achid chiih-è chiihphado branthek ro layogthek pha de achid ro. Ai awai shii mizid pha ishak shii luang jia idang pha mizid phijong ro. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Moses ro Iphey è bran hanyie yi akhriig ba pha ji shii Kho Phabithek rab; jishii hanyie yi Iphey è iidoh wuii pha ji shii Dufuii rab, chiih-è hanyie shii ne idang khriig rabjong pha ji shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro sbang ne surua rog shii rab.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Isu gethek ro Kho Phabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Chng 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zab gethek è nyie yao pha jine ji ro chiih-è hanyie yi hamangkhung hà Hamangkhung-aphuii ro so pha biang ro phazoi shii dug pha ji pha Kho Phabi um ro. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Ai ne Bajo So ithua Kho Phabi duiine blia rek, ji ne, haliig sbhang nyie yi tharothamang wad è asi pha Ithong è ruii pha ji ro.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Zab kho phabi shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii miiram zid phi pha chiih-è mizidthek phi pho ro chiih-è gethek ro Kho Phabi shii mizid pha ne nyie um chid. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Ai ne sohnyiak hà um arone ai ne phabi arey, nyieliieshii Jewish ro Iphey shii chid pha lasen phi pha ne phabithek um jong. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Mul 25:40</ref> </char></note> Phabithek duiine ithek è rek pha blia ne nui bie pha chiih-è hamangkhung hà nyie um pha ragia ji ro. Hì ne Moses rog shii um pha duiine ò ro. Ai è Shiinyie Haliig rab shii, Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yao, “Na è phiing shii nyie doh pha ji duiine zab rab bo.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Jishii thuh, Hamangkhung-aphuii nane awairo bran shii shiinyie shii khriig wie rab pha duiine Isu shii phi pha phabi blia ne ithek è de boh ba ro, nyieliieshii hìne wie manathek pha sbangthek duiine rab ro. <verse eid="HEB 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Ibi pha shiinyie rog shii ichiig oi arone jihà ne din pha ji arab chid phro. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jeri 31:31-34</ref> (LXX) </char></note> Jishii ai è yao shii, Hamangkhung-aphuii è ai bran rog shii ichiig doh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Ithong è yao, gu è Israel pha bran rog nane Judah pha bran rog shii iwo shiinyie rab pha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">inaithek ne thog sharuii ro.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Hì ne gu è ithek shii wad è noh ne ithek shii Egyph hà fuang noh pha inai shii gu è ithek ro blangthek shii rab pha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">shiinyie duiine asi phro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ithek gu è ithek shii shiinyie shii migi arek ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">chiih-è ji è gu ithek shii agayiig ro.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Thuh, Ithong è yao, inai thog ruii shii Israel pha bran rog shii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">gu è rab pha shiinyie ne hì ro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Gu ne gui ro iphey ithek khani shii chab phi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">chiih-è ithek lubuthek shii zey phi pha ro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Gu ne ithek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii rey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">chiih-è ithek ne gu bran rey ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>‘Ithong shii ìd bo ne’ Hanyie jia de awaithek iijiiak shii ayua sha phro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">awaithek ro hadung-haluiipho shii ayao sha phro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Chiih-è ìu de zabèboh de ithek ne zab gu shii thieg ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Gu ne ithek ro layog shii khung phi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">chiih-è awie pha ji shii khuchung de anow ruii phro.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Shiinyie iwo ji è yao srane, Hamangkhung-aphuii è rab, igobi pha jine ihèg rab; chiih-è nyie ihèg rey srane ùb ne sand dun phro.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sohnyiak pha nane hamangkhung pha misiasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Igobi pha shiinyie ne misiasia pha bohkhoh pha chiih-è misiasia pha ithua de um jine bran è rab ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Mul 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Mul 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Mul 25:23-30</ref></char></note> Nyie shii So Ithua rone yao pha haliig ji è ibi hà rab. Ji shii ne bunthruak nane Hamangkhung-aphuii shii mizid pha iweb um pha thiiebliie um ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Mul 26:31-33</ref></char></note> Dinpha yungshaig iidoh shii ne Bajo So Ithua rone ho pha haliig um ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Mul 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">Mul 25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">Mul 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Ssb 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Mul 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Iphy 10:3-5</ref></char></note> Jihà ne biisiie ziao pha san sraibao um chiih-è san è cheg pha Shiinyie Japho jia um chiih-è san jarai shii manna zan ne um ro, iirabthek khinrin pha Aron ro miichang de um, chiih-è muyungthek zey pha lubao thileg nyi de um. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Mul 25:18-22</ref></char></note> Jiha Hamangkhung-aphuii um rone yao pha japho lakhung shii iyig um pha ibeymuthung um ro, ithek iyig è shiiy, layogthek khung phi pha jiha cheg ruii. Jishii thuh ne zab ikhiing-ijuang yao pha ishak oi ro.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Ssb 18:2-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Hì duiine ji pha manathek shii khriig rek ne ruii ro. Phabithek ibi pha haliig hà wuii ne idang awaithek ro bliathek rek, <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lew 16:2-34</ref></char></note> jishii iliing pha Haliig biicho hàne Kho Phabi è wuii bie, chiih-è idam jia shii luang jia rek bie. Ai ne awai chiang nane athieg pha layog rek pha branthek chiang ai ne ifai yie ne iliing wuii rone Hamangkhung-aphuii shii mizid phi. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Ibi pha haliig ji nya-um sapho shii ne Bajo So Ithua wuii pha lumuii ne thuh thog pha ahong ba rone zab khriig rek ruii pha lumuii ji è Ragung So è sang è yuajong ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Jine thuh pha ishak pha cheb ro. Ji pha miyaosiu è ne mizidthek chiih-è miiram zidthek Hamangkhung-aphuii shii phi pha ji è ne misiasiaphothek ro lubu shii khriig arab muii, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>nyieliieshii ithek ne michie, muniing chiih-è yoh-yoh muhui pha iphey ji è rek bie. Jithek ne zab fuang pha khohthek, nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii è iwo muyung rab pha ishak athog sapho pha bie ro.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Jishii ichiih shii umjong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ichiih ne thogjong; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey ne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Thog sharuii. </char></note> pha wie manathek pha kho phabi duiine Masi wuiijong ro. Ai è blia rek pha haliig ne bajo boh nane bajo khriig ro; hìne bran wad è rab pha haliig asi ro. Hì ne, sohjambling pha ichua è rab pha asi ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Masi è haliig dong wuii shii, ai ne siphin fai nane rawoi mizid zid ne aphi ro; gethek shii idang pha chai mua yi pha ai ne awai nujo ro ifai yie ne Bajo So Ithua shii luang jia shii idang pha wuii. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Lew 16:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Ssb 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:19">19</ref></char></note> Siphinthek nane suwuiiduii ro ifai shii ziao pha sphie ne bran hanyie yi zeakho ji pha lakhung shii shun, chiih-è ji pha so rek phi pha ji è ithek shii ne mizen shii zea ji ruang rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Hì ne izai chak ro, Masi ro ifai è ne muna chiih-è sang rek ro idang pha Ragung è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii khriig zid pha ji ai ne awai shii mizid muii. Gethek shii isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii ro blia rek muii pha, airo ifai è gethek ro adunmey mizen pha lubu munow shii sud phi ro.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Hì pha chiang è shiinyie iwo shii rab Masi ro, ji è hanyie shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è ho pho shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è sbang rek pha idang khirzeythek shii choi ro. Jine nyarek mua nyieliieshii igobi pha shiinyie shii chun ramuii shii ithek è rek pha ichiigthek re-è branthek shii ichad rek phi pha jia iyjong ro.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Yang pha chiang ne bran hanyie è rab pha iy dun ro khagi rek pha miigak ro, Chiih-è yang pha miyaosiu ne hanyie rab pha bran ji isieng ba shiine nyie asi ro, jine ai iy dun pha iidoh ji è chun ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Hì ne ai iy pha iidoh è thoh ruii, rab pha bran ji sieng ba shii ne nyie de arey phro. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ji-è igobi pha shiinyie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shiinyie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grekh shii ji pha miyaogam siu ne “rey ruii” Chiih-è “shiinyie.” </char></note> ne ifai rog shii kho ne chun bie ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Mul 24:6-8</ref></char></note> Igobi, Moses è Iphey shii rek ne ruii pha ji duiine branthek shii zab pha muyungthek ji yao. Chiihphado rawoi nane siphin ifai yie ne kho rog shii lao, chiih-è Iphey pha jigi nane zab bran shii hysoph pha iphang nane ishaig miiriing shii kho ne shund phi. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Ai è yao, “nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii nuii bone yung pha ne shiinyie rog cheb rek pha ifai ro.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lew 8:15</ref> </char></note> Ji duiine Moses de shiinyie haliig shii nane misiasia shii kho pha zab manathek de ifai è fi phi. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lew 17:11</ref></char></note> Izai, Iphey ji è zab pha ne yangkho ifai sud ro, chiih-è ifai ji shund arone layogthek shii de khung mua ro.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi ro zid pha ji è layogthek shii yiedun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Ji pha manathek, nyie yi isbang hamangkhung è noi pha ji duiine sud ro. Jishii hamangkhung pha manathek awaithek ne ji è wie zidthek chid phro. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Masi nyie jine izai sbhang pha, bran wad è rab pha So Ithua hàne awuii ro, ai ne awailum ne hamangkhung hà dun dun, ai ne thuh gethek chiang Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii dongkhliie.<verse eid="HEB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Jewish pha phabi boh ne idamtham Bajo So Ithua hà miiram ifai rog shii wuii. Jishii Masi ne awai shii mizid pha bleb-bleb awuii ro, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>chiihphado sohjambling nyarab dang è yie ne thuh thog pha bame diig rek iwa. Ji pha chiang shii, thuh iidohè pha ishak moe è yie ne zab idam shii, awai shii zid pha ji è zab layogthek shii sud phi pha, ai ne luang jia idang pha khia ro. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Zab ne luang jia ne iy chid, chiih-è ji pha iidoh è Hamangkhung-aphuii chua ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note> Ji duiine Masi de bame ro layogthek ruang rek pha luang jia mizid zid muii ro, bajo layog shii ne khia fen mua. Ai ne layog chiang è asi pha, jishii hanyie aishii khan pho shii ragia rek pha din ne dong ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Jewish ro Iphey ne wie manathek sbhang thog ramuii pha ji pha ragey duiine ro; awai ne zai asi. Hì ne idamtham ne idang ò mizid zid pha ji phi ro. Chiihphado, Iphey ji ne, branthek hanyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii shii wuii ji pha zidthek khriig rey pha khi-è-rek magey phlei? <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Branthek Hamangkhung-aphuii shii misiasia pha ji è zai ithek layogthek shii sud arone, ithek ne din re-è layog pha ichiig rone athan, chiih-è zab zidthek ne gakdun phro. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Jishii, hìpha, zid ne idamtham ne bran pha ithek ro layogthek now yi ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Chiih-è rawoithek nane siphinthek ifai è ne layogthek shii akhia mua phro.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Chng 40:6-8</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note> Ji pha chiang, Masi sohjambling shii wuii shii, ai è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii yao:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Na ne zidthek nane mizidthek achid ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">jishii na è gu chiang siu shii saro phi.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Na ne sraibao shii ziao pha miiramthek shii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">chiih-è zidthek rog shii layogthek shii khia muii pha ji shii de asang ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Chiihphado gu ne yao, Hamangkhung-aphuii Wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Iphey pha jigi shii gu shii zey pha duiine ro, nathek è yang pha ji rek pha ‘Gune ichiih um ro.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Ai è ibi yaojong, “Na ne khuchung de ayang ro chiih-è zidthek chiih-è mizidthek sraibao shii ziao pha miiramthek de layogthek shii khia yi pha zidthek shii de na ne asang ro.” Hì pha mizid ne Iphey ji duiine zid magunde ai è hì yao ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Chiihphado ai è yao, Hamangkhung-aphuii Wo, na è yang pha ji rek pha “Gu ne ichiih um ro.” Ji-è Hamangkhung-aphuii zab ihèg zid shii fen muii srane Masi ro zid shii ji pha ithua hà ruii muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Nyieliieshii Isu Masi è Hamangkhung-aphuii ne aishii nyie rek phi bone yang pha ji rek phi, Gethek ne zab ai è awairo siu shii luang jia pha idang mizidthek phi pha ji è gethek ro layog è sud phi ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:38">Mul 29:38</ref> </char>
    </note> Zab Jewish inaitham ne awaithek ro blia rek chiih-è idang ò zid pha mizid, ji shii ji pha zid khuchung de layogthek shii ruang arek mua ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Chng 110:1</ref></char></note> Ji-arone, Masi, ne layogthek chiang luang jia mizid zid jong, mizid jine idang chun, chiih-è ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii pha phazoi hà dug dun ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Ji-è ai ne thuh ai ro makpho shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è airo lai liing hà aruii sapho thog pha ai ne khan muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Chiihphado, jia zid pha rog, hanyie yi layogthek è sud pho shii ne ai è idang khriigjong pha rab ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Chiih-è Ragung So de gethek shii airo khagi phi ro. Igobi ai è yao,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jeri 31:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Ithong è yao ro, Inai thog ruii shii hìpha shiinyie ne gu è ithek rog shii rab pha ji ro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Gu ne gu ro Iphemthek shii ithek ro lubuthek hà chab phi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">chiih-è awaithek khani shii zey phi pha ro.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jeri 31:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Chiihphado ai è yao, “ithek ro layogthek nane awie blia shii din ne anow sha phro.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Ji-è hì thek ne khungjong shii, mizid pha ji è layogthek shii ruang rek pha ji din ne achid sha ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cho gethek Hamangkhung-aphuii moe hà wuii sha rai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Chiihphado, gu iijiiakthek, Isu iy miyao ji è gethek shii Bajo So Ithua hà wuii mua pha zab ichad sha ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Ai ne gethek shii yung saig ji è lumuii iwo, sieng pha lumuii shii hong phi ro—Ji ne ai awairo siu ji ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii hò pha ilkhi bajoboh phabi ne gethek rog shii um ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lew 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezkh 36:25</ref> </char></note> Ji-è cho gethek ne wie lubu nane izai migi rog, chiih-è ichiig è sudjong pha lubu chiih-è khow so è sud pha siuthek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii moe hà wuii rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Ji-è cho gethek ne gethek è rek pha gethek ro luthong chuh è kho rai haro, nyieliieshii gethek ai ro sbang rai rone Hamangkhung-aphuii shii migi rek mua ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Cho gethek ne nong rai chiih-è miie rone doh yi chiih-è wie rek pha now rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Cho gethek ne gai è rek ramuii pha duiine, gethek è ò shii male rek pha lajia pha ji shii athoh haro. Ji phachiang shii, Ithong pha Inai nui thog pha nathek è doh pha ji è cho gethek chung zab shii mana lububo rek rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Chiih-è gethek izai ji ìd yi pha iidoh shii gethek è layogthek rek arone layogthek shii sud pha gai zid oi sha ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Aij 26:11</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Ji phachiang shii, zab thog ramuii pha chua shii chiih-è hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii suang rek pho bai è ziao pha rum ji shii khan bie ro! <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Iphy 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> Hanyie magunde Moses ro Iphey shii anuii pho ne aishii ne bushun arek pha bran nyi uom khagi rek ne ua muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Mul 24:8</ref></char></note>Chiihphado, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Dufuii shii hanyie è snai pho shii, chiih-è layogthek è ithek shii sud pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shiinyie ifai ji shii igong oi pha duiine rek pho shii nyie rey ruii phlei? Nyieliieshii ai ne Ragung pha bushun shii de makhak-riing, ji è ithek shii chua ne khama buii rey ruii phro! <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Iphy 32:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:36">Iphy 32:36</ref></char></note> Chiih-è gethek ne thieg hanyie yao, “Gu ne rog din ruii, Gu ne phi din ruii phro” Chiih-è ai hì de yao, “Ithong ne awai bran shii chua ruii phro.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii wad shii thog pha ne bajo buii ro!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Igobi hà na rog shii nyie umjong pha ji shii now bo. Hamangkhung-aphuii ro muchuang nathek lakhung shii phi pha inai iidoh shii nathek ne bajo manathek shii diig rek, ji shii rang de nathek shii ne diig ji è ayang mua ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Ji pha ishak nathek shii ne hong ne makhak-riing ne khui chiih-è ishak jia shii hanyie rog shii hì è rey pho rog shii nong pha saro ro. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Na è phathegphothek ro diigchiaothek shii thang, chiih-è nathek ro manathek shii ne zab reo, nathek ne nawaithek munow rey pha ji shii lised ne zud, nyieliieshii nyie yi idang rey ne rai pha wie manathek jine thuh de nathek shii um bamuii rone nathek ne thieg ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Nawaithek ro lububo rek pha ji shii amua rabo, chiihphado, nyieliieshii jine bajoboh lasen mua ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è yang pha ji shii blia rek pha nane chiih-è ai è nyie sbang rek pha ji shii choi pha Na ne jum rek bo. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37-38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:3-4">Heb 2:3-4</ref> (LXX) </char></note> Chiih-è, jigi shii yao pha duiine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“ìu jia pha ishak shii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">chiih-è hanyie wuiiramuii pha jine wuii phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">ai ne achia phro.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Guro rangsua branthek ne, migi rek ne sieng ruii phro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">jishii hanyie magunde iidoh khid din arone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Gu ne ithek rog shii asang din sha phro.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Gethek ne iidoh khid pha bran nane mua pha asi ro. Ji phachiang shii gethek ne migi rek chiih-è ragia rey ro.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Migi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Migi um pha ji è gethek luthong pha manathek shii ne zai mua ruii, gethek è adoh pha manathek jine um rone migi rek. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Buyo ishak pha bran ithek ro migi è Hamangkhung-aphuii è nuii phi pha ji shii yang.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Igo 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Chng 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jon 1:3</ref></char>
    </note> Hì ne migi è gethek gao zab hamangnyiak ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro miyaogam è rab ro, ji è nyie doh pha ji shii ne nyie adoh pha ji è rab ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Igo 4:3-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Airo migi è Abel è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii Khain è de wie mizid phi. Airo migi ji è ai ne rangsua pha bran rone Hamangkhung-aphuii è nuii phi, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii awai è airo lasenthek shii nuii phi. Ai iyjong magun airo migi pha miyaosiu è Abel ne thuh de yao bamuii ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Igo 5:21-24</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Migi ji è Enokh shii a-iy yie. Ji pha chiang è aishii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii hà noh dun, chiih-è hanyie de aishii adoh mua, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii noh dun. Jigi shii yao Enokh shii laziung noh dun pha ibi shii ai è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang yi ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Hanyie jia de migi arek pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang arek mua phro, hanyie magun Hamangkhung-aphuii shii wuiipho ne Hamangkhung-aphuii idang um rone chiih-è hanyie aishii sowpho ne lasen phi rone migi um chid.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Migi ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii è ai adoh pha phariang pha manathek shii phriie pha ji shii Noah è yoi ro. Nyie yi Ai nane airo haliingpho ragia rey mua pha ai è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii nuii srane run jia rab. Idohhè shii sohjambling shii ne the dun, chiih-è migi ji è thog pha Hamangkhung-aphuii ro rangsuathek ne Noah è choi ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Igo 12:1-5</ref></char></note> Migi chiang shii nyie shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii phi phro ne sbang rek pha soh shii wuii Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii ho shii Abraham è nuii phi ro. Ai ne khi hà wuiiramuii pha jine nyie de athiegdang awai soh shii thoh marui. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Igo 35:27</ref></char></note> Migi chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii sbang rek pha soh hà ai ne fuang bran duiine rai ro. Ai ne haliigthek shii rai, hanyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ò sbang ji Isakh nane Jakhob de haliigthek shii rai. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Chiih-è Abraham ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è izey rab chiih-è idang pha sarong rog shii rajan rab pha ji shii khan muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Igo 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note>Migi chiang è ai ne bajo weg magunde chiih-è Sarah awai ani agiak magunde Abraham ne aphuii rey dun ro. Ai ne airo sbang rey yi pha ai ne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hì ne migi, aniphiing. Airo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hì ne migi ji rab Sarah awai shii now yi pha, ai bajo miriang magunde aniphiing um. Ai.</char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii shii migi rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Igo 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note>Abraham ro siu ne iy dun pha duiine ro, ai è hamang pha dadiangthek duiine chiih-è khamuiiring pha bajo baligamthek duiine airo riingthek wuii ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:4">Igo 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Phal 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Chng 39:12</ref></char>
    </note> Migi ji è zab ji pha bran ne iy dun. Ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è sbang rek pha manathek shii ayie mua ro, jishii ithek ne ruang è ithek shii doh chiih-è ithek shii wieho, ithek ne sohnyiak shii fuang pha branthek nane gai branthek shii rey ne rai pha ji shii nuii phi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Hanyie è jithek shii yao pha mana ne sang è ìd yi ithek ne awaithek ro soh shii sow ramuii ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Ithek ne awaithek è thohjong pha soh shii anow ro; ithek ne now arone, ithek shii ne iidoh khid pha choi um ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Ji phachiang shii, hìne ithek è thoh marui pha ji è de bajo wie pha soh hamangkhung pha soh ji shii chid ro. Chiih-è ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii ne awai ne ithek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii rone yao phane awo ro, nyieliieshii ai ithek shii rajan saro phi ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Igo 22:1-14</ref></char></note> Migi ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii è Abraham shii chai pha rek shii Abraham ne awai dufuii Isakh shii mizid sha pha rek ro. Abraham ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è sbang rek pha jia ro. Jimagunde ai ne awai dufuii shii zid pha duiine mizid pha saro rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Igo 21:12</ref></char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii yao, “Gu è sbang rek pha naro riingthek ne Isakh è rey ruii phro.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Abraham ne ìdjong Hamangkhung-aphuii ne Isakh shii iy pha ji è nyahoi mua—Chiih-è, ji è, zai Abraham ne Isakh shii iy pha ji è choi din ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Igo 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char>
    </note> Migi chiang shii Isakh è Jakhob nane Esau shii phariang pha khirzeythek shii sbang rek ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">Igo 48:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 47:31">Igo 47:31</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Migi chiang è Jakhob è awai iy pha ibi shii Joseph ro dufuiithek shii khirzey phi. Ai ne thagin è gin ne chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii misiasia.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 50:24">Igo 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Mul 13:19</ref></char>
    </note> Migi chiang shii Joseph è awai iy sha pha nui thog sha shii ai è Israelthek ro Egyph è thoh ne dun ruii phro ne yao, chiih-è airo siu rog shii nyie rey pha chiang shii de yua phi.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:2">Mul 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Mul 1:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Migi chiang shii Moses pha aphuii-amuii è ai giak pha iidoh aishii habie uom ug ne yie ro. Ithek è aishii bajo khie ani rone riig, chiih-è ithek ne sajathek muyung shii anuii pha rek pha ji de arum. <verse eid="HEB 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Mul 2:10-12</ref></char></note> Migi chiang shii Moses è ai chai rey pha ishak shii, sajathek dimi pha ani rone aho yie. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Ai ne layog shii ìujia ishak lubo liak shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bran rog shii diig rek pha ji wie ba rone guajong ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Ai è nohjong Egyph pha zab nuruiithek è ne Masaiya chiang diigchiao shii zud pha ji wie ba ro, nyieliieshii airo mieg yi phariang pha lasen shii riig muii ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Hì ne migi re-è rey ro Moses ne sajathek ro lijiègthek shii arum pha Egyph thoh muii ro. Ai ne adoh pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii do, ji è ai ne iidoh khid pha ji shii anuii ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Mul 12:21-30</ref></char></note> Migi ji è aishii hiìadun pha ji shii rab yie chiih-è Iy pha Khlei è Israelthek pha igobi giak pha dufuiithek shii a-ua yi pha habin shii ifai fi pha yung ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Mul 14:21-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Migi è Israelthek ne igo soh duiine Khamuii Saig è hiìa dun, Egyphthek è ji rek pha bidiang shii ithek shii kho è lim muii ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Jos 6:12-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Migi è Jerikho pha muthuathek shii Israelthek è inai miley lua ne shan pha iidoh shii chuakdun. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">Jos 6:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Jos 2:1-21</ref></char></note> Migi ji è, siulao rek pha Rahab shii ne hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii anuii pho rog shii ne a-ua ro, nyieliieshii ai ne Israelthek pha bujuiiphothek shii wie è ho phi.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Chua 6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">Chua 4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">Chua 13:2—16:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">Chua 11:1—12:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1-2:11">1Sam 16:1—1Saj 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1Sam 1:1—25:1</ref></char>
    </note> Gu ne yao lumuii habey? Gideon, Barag, Samson, Jephtha, Dawid, Samuel, chiih-è chaigthek pha yao phane ishak acho sha ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6:1-27</ref></char></note> Migi ji è ithek ne zab ro soh shii mak rek ne yang ge. Ithek ne nyie izai ji shii rek chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyie sbang rek pha ji shii choi ge ro. Ithek ne bargithek sem shii de kheb muii, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3:1-30</ref></char></note> bai hòi shii de nyia muii khamriie è de ragia rek ge ro. Ithek ne zia, jishii gang rey dun; ithek ne mak shii de riichaiboh um chiih-è fuangphothek pha arming re-è de yang gey ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Saj 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Saj 4:25-37</ref></char></note> Migi ji è hò-amuii ne awaithek ro iyjong pha siangthangthek ji è hòi pha muii din ne yie ro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Gaithek ne ichad shii snai, wie chai shii hìpha chiang khui ne iy dun. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1Saj 22:26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 22:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2Phal 18:25</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jeri 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> Giak ne makhak-riing chiih-è chia, chiih-è giak shii ne shiirnaithek è phang ne phatheg hà chab muii ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Phal 24:21</ref></char></note> Ithek shii ne lubao è chao, ithek shii ne aroh è nyirang laigthek muii, ithek shii ne khamriie è ua muii ro. Ithek ne shiishai nane siphin khug guii—Ithek ne dusho chiih-è diigchiao, chiih-è ithek shii ne gayiig de arek. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Sohjambling ne ithek shii wie acho ro! Ithek ne wogthek hà chiih-è nyaliag ichothek hà rai ne balimuangthek nane phiingduiithek shii gai branthek duiine lua muii ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Hì thek zab sasab ne ithek ro migi um pha ji è yang ge ro! Jimagunde Thuh de ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è sbang rek pha ji shii ne achoi ro. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii ne ji è de wie phakjong. Ai è gethek rog shii ò rek ne ithek shii khriig rab pha ji chid bie ro.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii gethek aphuii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Gethek pha, ne boh ibrog pha khagi shand ne um ro. Ji-è chiihphado, cho gethek lumuii shii dog pha ji shii ruang rek chiih-è layog è chuh kho pha ji è de zab ruang rek rai haro, chiih-è cho gethek shii ran pha um pha ji shii lubu è phi ne ran rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Cho gethek ro mieg hanyie shii gethek ro migi shii ibi è iidohè thog pha luthong pha Isu shii riig rai haro. Ai ne bai shii riig srane athoh muii ro! Ji phachiang shii, nyieliieshii ai è khan pha lubo ne, ai ne bai shii iy pha chiang shii nyie de anow ro. Chiih-è ai ne thuh Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biang phazoi hà dug ne rai muii ro.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Ai ne khama diig rek ne lua chiih-è layogphothek è aishii khama khiijai pha jine now bo! Ji-è nawai shii lubu ìu rek athoh rabo. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Chiih-è naro layog suang pha mak shii ne na ne thuh de iy bsa thog pha zud ne arek ba ro. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5:17</ref> </char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai ani duiine nathek shii yao pha lububo rek pha miyaogamthek ne nathek bia dun bey?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Gu ani, Ithong è na shii yua shii wie nuii bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">Chiih-è ai è nathek shii giung shii lubu-ìu arek rabo.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Nyieliieshii ai è miie pha ji shii ne Ithong è wie yua ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">chiih-è awai ani duiine choi pha zab shii lagothek phi ro.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Aphuii ro lago duiine now ne na è diig rek pha ji shii zud bo; naro diig rek pha ji Hamangkhung-aphuii ne na shii awai ani duiine rek rone doh yi ro. Aphuii è lago aphi pha dufuii ne hanyie um bey? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Awairo zab ani duiine na shii lago aphi arone, ji pha miyaosiu è ne na ne ani sbhang asi ro, jishii duroi ro. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Gethek ro pha bran aphuiithek è yao arone, ithek è gethek shii lago phi chiih-è gethek ne ithek shii ilab phi. Chiihphado, gethek ne gethek ro ragung pha Aphuii shii phi ne sieng pha jine ji è de boh ro! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Ithek è khriig rone riig shii; gethek bran pha aphuiithek è gethek shii lago phi phane ìujia ishak ro, jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii ne gethek shii wie pha ji rek, ji è gethek ne airo sothek ji shii thang mua pha rek ro. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Gethek shii lago phi magey shii, ji pha ishak shii gethek shii ìujia ishak zo yi, chiih-è alised yi ro. Jimagunde iidoh hanyie è ji pha lago shii isiie rekpho shii rangsuathek chai pha liijiing lasen shii ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muyungthek nane phriiethek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Aij 35:3</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Chiihphado, nawaithek ro jid pha wadthek chiing magey bo, chiih-è nawaithek ro lagiung sham pha ji shii ne chuh rek bo! <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Lumuii mieng shii lua ne ruii bo, ji è laidadiang alua mua yi pha arek pha, jishii ji pha chiangg shii gang yi bo.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Zab jia rog shii liijiing rek pha bidiang bo, chiih-è so chai rai pha bidiang bo, nyieliieshii sothek oi arone hanyie jia de Ithong shii adoh ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Iphy 29:18</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun è iidoh khid din yi pha suang shii ragia rek bo. Hanyie jia de misieng khow sieng pha ji duiine arey rabo chiih-è ai ro idiig ne bame diig rey ro. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Igo 25:29-34</ref></char></note> Hanyie jia de siulao arek rabo, chiih-è hanyie è dufuii dukho re ne luang jia chie pha awai rangsuathek shii liu muii pha Esau duiine ragung oi pha duiine arey rabo. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Igo 27:30-40</ref> </char></note> Ji pha idoh, na ne ìd, ai ne awai aphuii ro khirzey shii choi pha yang; jishii aishii ne iidoh khid din yi, chiih-è ai ne miegkhothek rog shii sow magunde ai è rekjong pha ji shii nyie lumuii chua amua ro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ai ne ji shii riig; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ai ne khirzey mua yi pha rek.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Mul 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Iphy 4:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char>
    </note> Na è nyie shii nyathan mua, Sinai phiing pha bai hang rog shii, igiia nane hòthab, hasamkhanoi shii, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>Phiong pha thu-ung è, chiih-è gu ro pha Sinai Phiing shii Israel pha branthek wuii pha duiine, na ne awuii ro. Bran è goh yoi magey shii, gai miyaogam ayoi yi rabo ne ithek ne khung, <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Mul 19:12-13</ref> </char></note> nyieliieshii ithek nyie yao pha muyung shii ne azid mua ro, “miiram è phiing shii khoh arone, jine iy pha lubao è chao chid ro.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Iphy 9:19</ref></char></note> Moses è yao pha ji riig pho ne bajo rum um ro, “Gu ne sham ne rumdun!” <verse eid="HEB 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Ji phachiang shii, na ne hamangkhung pha Jerusalem itham hamangkhliiethek rai pha Zion pha Phiing nane isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii ro rajan shii wuii. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Hamangkhung hà hanyie ro ibeng zeyjong pha, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ibi giak pha lubo khrab bsa hà nathek wuii ro. Nathek ne hanyie yi zab bran shii chua pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii wuii ge ro, chiih-è khriig bran shii isiie rabjong pha ragungthek hà wuii ro. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Igo 4:10</ref></char></note> Nathek ne hanyie è shiinyie wo rab, chiih-è Abel pha ifai è de huàk ne ifai shund pha sbang rek pha Isu shii wuii ge ro.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:22">Mul 20:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wie gayiig bo, chiihphado, hanyie è yao ji shii yoi pha asnai rabo. Hanyie è sohnyiak shii so mua yao pha ji ayoi rone ayao mua ro. Chiihphado, gethek ne hamangkhung è yao pha ji è khiddun arone gethek yoh pha lumuii ne bajo ìu ro! <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Ji pha ishak shii airo goh ne sohnyiak shii sham magey, jishii thuh ne ai è sbang rek, “Gu ne din ne soh shii asham bie pha hamangkhung shii de sham ruii phro.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>“Din ne luang jia” Miyaogamthek è ne rab pha manathek ne sham ne chiing ruii phro ne sang riig yi ro, ji è manathek ne asham mua pha ji shii rai ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Chiihphado, cho gethek ne lasothek phi haro, nyieliieshii gethek ne sajathua asham muii pha ji shii choi ge ro. Cho gethek ne laso phi ne chiih-è ilab nane rum srane aishii sang yi lumuii ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii misiasia; <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Iphy 4:24</ref></char></note> nyieliieshii gethek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii ne zai srobro rek mua pha bai ro.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii shii khi-è rek ne sang yi chid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Masipho khuiinothek duiine nawaithek chung moe shii ruii bo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Igo 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> Athieg pha biwenthek shii nawai hò hà hopha abia rabo. Giak è ne athieg pha biwenthek ho shii hamangkhliie shii ho jong. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Phathegpho shii now srane, nawai de ithek rog phatheg hà duiine now bo. Diigchiaopho shii now srane ithek diigchiaopho ji shii nawai è rad pha duiine now bo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Yiy-gey pha ji shii ne zab ilab phi chid, chiih-è yiy nane gey chung ne migi um rai chid. Hamangkhung-aphuii ne hanyie shii lubu oi hanyie è siulao rek ithek chua ruii phro.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Bang miie ne sgow pha ji è nawai shii ruang ruii bo, chiih-è nawai shii nyie um pha ji shii cho bo. Nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii è yao, “Gu ne na shii athoh phro; gu ne na shii asnai phro.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Chng 118:6</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Chiihphado, lubu boh rek srane yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Ithong ne garo nongpho ro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Gu ne arum phro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Gu shii hanyie nyie rek mua phiiga?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Hanyie è nathek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro mua yao, nathek ro ibi pha dumuiithek shii now bo. Iidoh pha ji now bo ithek ne khi-è rek ne sieng ithek khi-è rek ne iy chiih-è ithek ro migi shii noi bo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Isu Masi ne duyo, sdoh chiih-è idang ò ro. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Izai lumuii ji è nathek ne zab athieg pha muyua pha jihà adun yi rabo. Hì ne hanyie shii hìpha nuii pha ji è khoh ne ithek è anong pha michie chiang shii khoh nuii pha ji shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bushun è iliing pha chua shii choi pha ji wie ro.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Phabithek hanyie Jewish ithua pha misiasia sraibao zid nyie um pha ji shii chie phane rangsua oi ro. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lew 16:27</ref></char></note> Jewish pha Kho Phabi ne layog chiang shii miiram ro ifai yie ne Bajo So Ithua hà mizid zid; jishii miiram siu shii ne haliig è fuang hà ziao muii. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Ji pha chiang, aiwai ro ifai è branthek ro layog shii gang rek phi pha, Isu de rajan è fuang hà iy. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Chiihphado, cho gethek de, haliig è fuang hà aishii wuii ne chiih-è airo biwo shii thang rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Chiih-è ichiih sohnyiak shii ne gethek ro idang pha rajan ithua oi ro; gethek ne nyie thog ruii pha rajan shii khan ro. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Chiihphado, cho gethek de, nyie yi aishii Ithong rone sphunthek è nuii ne Isu chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii idang mizid chiong ne zid rai haro. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Wie shii rek pha abia rabo chiih-è nawaithek chung nong rai bo, nyieliieshii hìpha zid jine Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang yi ro.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Nawaithek ro dumuiithek shii nuii bo chiih-è ithek muyungthek shii luagieng bo. Ithek ne nathek luruak shii athohdang pha riig muii, nyieliieshii ithek ne ithek ro blia rek pha ji shii Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sasab phi chid phro. Nathek ithek shii nuii arone, ithek ne awaithek blia shii lised ne rek ruii phro; asi arone, ithek ne zo ne rek ruii phro, chiih-è jine nathek shii nong oi ruii phro. <verse eid="HEB 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Gathek shii misia shii ruii bo. Gethek ne zai nyayao mua gethek munow ne sang ro, nyieliieshii gethek ne zab ishak shii zai shii rek yang. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Chiih-è gu shii khthiie iidoh nathek moe shii thoh din yi pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sia bone gu ne ithek shii lubu è khung phro.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zab sha pha misia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20-21"/>Gethek Ithong Isu Masi shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è iy pha ji hòi din yi; ai è awai ifai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20-21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Airo ifai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ai zid ne iy.</char></note> phi muii pha chiang ai ne shiishai pha Bajobo Shiishaibrogpho rey, ji pha chiang è idang pha shiinyie nabjong. Yang ne liijiing Hamangkhung-aphuii è na shii airo yang pha ji shii rek yi pha zab wie mana ji shii phi yi pha, chiih-è Isu Masi chiang, gethek chai shii ai è sang pha ji shii rek yi bo. Chiih-è biisiie ne idang è idang pha Masi ro! Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:20-21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha miyaogamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Gu nathek shii khung, gu iijiiakthek hìpha lububo rek pha mua shii wie è nui bo; gu è nathek shii zey pha jigi hìne phiang asi ro. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Gu ne nathek shii gethek khuiino Thimothi phatheg è khia ge pha ji shii ìd yi pha yang ro. Ai khthiie thog arone, aishii gurog noh srane nathek shii si pha wuii pha ro.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Nathek ro dumuiithek shii chiih-è zab Hamangkhung-aphuii bran shii gathek ro salamthek phi bo. Ithaly pha migiphothek è de nathek shii salamthek thoh gey. <verse eid="HEB 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne nathek zab rog rai bo.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
